<title>USA: PS Colo. Hayden unit 2 seen up late Tues.</title>
<headline>PS Colo. Hayden unit 2 seen up late Tues.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Service Co of Colorado expects the 262 megawatt (MW) unit 2 at the Hayden power station to be back on line late today, a company spokesman said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Steamboat Springs, Colo., unit was shut at 2400 MDT Thursday for scheduled maintenance.</p>
<p>&quot;Fire is in the boiler and we expect the unit to begin operating around 1500 or 1600 MDT this afternoon,&quot; said spokeswoman Susan Stallworth.</p>
<p>The Hayden plant's 180 MW unit 1 is operating normally, the utility said.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau, + 1 213 955 6761</p>
